{"componentChunkName":"component---src-pages-new-projects-js","path":"new-projects/in-rehan","result":{"serverData":{"data":{"status":true,"hits":[{"rank":null,"slug":"rehan-arada-properties-muwaileh-commercial","about":"Rehan is a residential development in Sharjah, UAE, successfully realised by Arada Properties. The complex consists of three 6-storey buildings and offers spacious apartments of different configurations, including elegant studios, as well as 1 and 2-bedroom residences. The apartments have panoramic windows and a spacious balcony. The interior design is at a premium level.The residents of the complex will be able to use Wi-Fi, intercom, cable TV and air conditioning. Rehan has a children's and adult swimming pool, a common equipped gym, a fitness centre and a café, which allows residents to spend their free time perfectly. In addition, the ground floor retail area has a pharmacy, laundry, beauty salon and clothing shop. The complex has a covered car park for residents‘ and guests’ cars. The building is secured 24/7.The project is very conveniently located in the Aljada area, almost in the heart of Sharjah city centre, making it very convenient for residents to reach important places. Public transport is available in the community, and bus, tram and metro stations are within walking distance of the apartments. Aljawwia Airport can be reached in 11 minutes, while Sharjah Airport is 13 minutes away.","price":899000,"title":"Rehan","bitrix":{"id":927,"pf_id":null,"source":null,"project_id":"Rehan","tower_name":null,"campaign_name":"Rehan","property_type":"Villas","developer_name":"Arada Developments","project_location":"Muwaileh Commercial"},"images":[{"340x252":"https://d3h330vgpwpjr8.cloudfront.net/x/off-plan/2697/images/2024/07/31/340x252/2aMgqBBqwOQ7WWWRDucrQ4yXwkGrOqDXJnxRJ03Z.webp","464x312":"https://d3h330vgpwpjr8.cloudfront.net/x/off-plan/2697/images/2024/07/31/464x312/2aMgqBBqwOQ7WWWRDucrQ4yXwkGrOqDXJnxRJ03Z.webp"}],"status":"pending","_geoloc":